    "collapse_content_PmMV3m": {
      "type": "collapse-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapse_VFkR3z": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Will it work with my Phone?</p>",
            "content": "<p>TapNest is designed for <strong>MagSafe-compatible iPhones and MagSafe cases</strong>, with iOS Shortcuts enabled for the full NFC experience. Android devices are not supported at this time. <br/><br/><em>Note: For best results, avoid thick, metallic, or non-MagSafe cases, as these may affect magnetic hold or NFC sensitivity.</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_ncUxWX": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>How do I set the NFC Shortcuts?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Watch our quick <a href=\"/pages/nfc-shortcut-gallery\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How to set up the shortcuts?\">video tutorial</a> to get started — setup only takes a few minutes. <br/><br/>If you're looking for inspiration, our <a href=\"/pages/nfc-shortcut-gallery\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How to set up the shortcuts?\">Shortcuts Gallery</a> has plenty of ideas to get you going. </p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_VAbL78": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Can I use TapNest without NFC?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. The docking feature is the one our customers reach for most — it just fits naturally into your routine. NFC takes it a step further, adding a little ease to the moments you repeat every day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_i6b3pR": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Where should I place it?</p>",
            "content": "<p>TapNest is made for smooth bathroom mirrors, glass, or tile — ideally somewhere near your natural eye line. Just wipe the surface clean and dry before applying. <br/><br/>That said, feel free to place it anywhere the tap-and-snap experience would make your space work better for you.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "collapse_VFkR3z",
        "collapse_ncUxWX",
        "collapse_VAbL78",
        "collapse_i6b3pR"
      ],
